## Project Structure
```
MOSolvers.jl/
├── src/
│   ├── MOSolvers.jl           # Package entry point
│   ├── solvers/               # High-level algorithms (PDFPM, CondG, …)
│   ├── subproblems/           # Low-level convex subproblem routines
│   └── utils/                 # Shared helpers (finite differences, line search,…)
├── test/                      # Unit & regression tests
└── docs/                      # User & developer documentation (Documenter.jl)
```